  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Multiple countries &#x2013; Gitrex Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within this Orange Corners (OC) Alumni project 20 tech (enabled) entrepreneurs will have the possibility to participate in one of Africa&#x2019;s leading tech events.The project1.	aims to make long term connections between OC alumni in Africa that run tech-enabled businesses;2.	creates an enabling environment for OC alumni wherein they can significantly increase their network with for example clients, partners, investors, mentors and friends;3.	improves the skills and (industry) knowledge of young tech entrepreneurs &#x2013; through training of all sorts provided by both Gitex and the implementing organisation.</narrative>
  </description>
